        <mxCell id="note" value="CORRECTIONS APPLIED: (1) Added missing data store D10: staff_alerts (migration 022 — used by fraudFlags.js auto-suspend, slaEscalationScheduler.js, and staff.js alert inbox). (2) Process 3.0 now writes auto-suspend alerts to D10 and forwards an Alert List to OSCA/PDAO Admin. (3) Process 6.0 (via the SLA scheduler) now writes SLA-breach alerts to D10. Actual system table count is 10, not 9." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=11;fontColor=#B85450;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#B85450;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="20" width="860" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

